{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The client for &quot;SBMFR&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE this game uses dedicated servers...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need any help setting this up let me know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of settings to play around on a per team basis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a steamdeck I had to go to properties -&gt; compatability.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 then check &quot;force the use of a specific Steam Play compatability tool&quot; then select\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;Steam Linux Runtime 1.0 (scout)&quot; I also had to change the resolotion setting to 1920x1080</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297420?t=1767796321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297420?t=1767796321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297420/e69cd9a9e0900f19d37b7cd729cd09b870190a82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767796321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297420/e69cd9a9e0900f19d37b7cd729cd09b870190a82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767796321","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The client for &quot;SBMFR&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE this game uses dedicated servers...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need any help setting this up let me know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of settings to play around on a per team basis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a steamdeck I had to go to properties -&gt; compatability.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 then check &quot;force the use of a specific Steam Play compatability tool&quot; then select\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;Steam Linux Runtime 1.0 (scout)&quot; I also had to change the resolotion setting to 1920x1080</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Peter Bruce"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297420/ea5f9b1a947b8b877bd0b00e7978c6b873441c6c/header.jpg?t=1767796321","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3297420/791547166/2dde41759733b7b43347104d711b1fd867b5bb70/1767795934/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767796320","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3297420/791547166/2dde41759733b7b43347104d711b1fd867b5bb70/1767795934/dash_h264.mpd?t=17